  displayName: "T\xEDa Isabel"
  characterFullName: Isabel
  alias: "T\xEDa Isabel, Capit\xE1n Tiago\u2019s Cousin "
  characterCategory: Household Member / Hostess
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7f3666917c32d5b4c9e885371d1ff39a, type: 3}
  description: "An elderly and good-natured cousin of Capit\xE1n Tiago who receives
    the female guests at his gathering. Although well-meaning, she struggles to speak
    Spanish and soon becomes tired of her ceremonial duties."
  biography: "Isabel is Capit\xE1n Tiago\u2019s cousin and the only woman initially
    receiving the female guests at the gathering. She offers cigars and buyos to
    the Spanish women and extends her hand for Filipino women to kiss in imitation
    of the friars\u2019 social custom. She speaks Spanish poorly and quickly becomes
    bored with the reception. After hearing a plate break, she rushes away to reprimand
    the servants and does not return to her position."
  characterFacts:
  - "She is Capit\xE1n Tiago\u2019s cousin."
  - Her name was not revealed til later.
  - She is described as an elderly woman with a sweet face.
  - She speaks Spanish poorly.
  - She receives the female guests at the gathering.
  - She offers cigars and buyos to Spanish women.
  - She allows Filipino women to kiss her hand.
  - She abandons the reception after hearing a plate break.
  introductionLines:
  - Good evening. I am Isabel, a cousin of Capitan Tiago. I am helping receive his
    guests tonight.
  - ...
  - "Jes\xFAs! Just wait, you rascals!"
  repeatDialogues:
